# The same app in a small window: Home becomes one column and everything still fits.
Output docs/narrow.gif
Source tapes/style.tape
Set Width 760
Set Height 760

Hide
Type "tapes/demo.sh history"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

Sleep 3s
Down@300ms 12
Sleep 2s
# Stats, narrow
Tab@400ms 6
Sleep 3s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
